# ==============================================================================
# Sri Shahrukh Lake Resort - Email Configuration (Gmail SMTP)
# ==============================================================================
#
# To receive room booking inquiries directly in lakeresortsrishahrukh@gmail.com:
#
# 1. Log into your Google Account for lakeresortsrishahrukh@gmail.com
# 2. Ensure 2-Step Verification is ON (https://myaccount.google.com/security)
# 3. Create an App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    - Select app name: "Resort Website"
#    - Google will give you a 16-character password (e.g. abcd efgh ijkl mnop)
# 4. Paste it into EMAIL_PASS in your .env.local file
#
# ==============================================================================

EMAIL_USER=lakeresortsrishahrukh@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your_16_character_gmail_app_password
